                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "4530e61b-87d0-3ef3-a5d1-fa03a0235ba6",
                        "entry_id": "d986d178-1150-33dc-9c42-33cc6408fa02",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Qui concerne Phobos, lune de Mars."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "rare"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "82093056-221a-4a59-8a2a-d3fcea233ac9",
                                "sense_id": "4530e61b-87d0-3ef3-a5d1-fa03a0235ba6",
                                "text": "Dans le ciel phobosien, la planète se présente sous un angle de 42° : on ne voit qu’elle. Les Soviétiques comptent bien exploiter cette possibilité : ils prévoient que, depuis une orbite voisine de celle de Phobos, leurs sondes se livreront à une étude de Mars et singulièrement de son atmosphère avec l’appareil franco-soviétique August. […] Une inconnue est actuellement la libration dont il [Phobos] est à coup sûr animé, mais sa détermination est l’objet de l’expérience que les Français ont prévu d’exécuter avec le senseur optique Sténopée qui suivra le mouvement du Soleil dans le ciel phobosien ; cette libration se reflétera par ailleurs par une modulation des émissions de la balise radioélectrique."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "39644c88-981e-4974-a9d8-7b80d3b68790",
                        "source_entry_id": "d986d178-1150-33dc-9c42-33cc6408fa02",
                        "source_sense_id": "4530e61b-87d0-3ef3-a5d1-fa03a0235ba6",
                        "target_lang_word": "Phobosian",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Phobosian",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9c5e2103-0170-3207-8649-439ee5c4a039",
                                        "entry_id": "4defa471-54f9-32fb-a5a7-cc820599d87a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Pertaining to Phobos."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8ea15485-70cd-4902-8d97-080400aaa476",
                                                "sense_id": "9c5e2103-0170-3207-8649-439ee5c4a039",
                                                "text": "The origin of superheavy ions (M/q>100) is still open. Have it the Phobosian or the Martian origin?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "320ea56a-b584-4f21-822a-7c85919d79fb",
                                                "sense_id": "9c5e2103-0170-3207-8649-439ee5c4a039",
                                                "text": "Far out across the Dust Sea, a great, rolling cloud of debris was being blown high into the Phobosian sky—easily eclipsing the plume generated by Beuller's pulses—fifty, maybe sixty meters up and rising."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "681ea659-c4c9-4624-a39e-d202b057d24b",
                                                "sense_id": "9c5e2103-0170-3207-8649-439ee5c4a039",
                                                "text": "In addition to the work done related to data from the eliptical orbits of Phobos-2, some groups have also used data from the circular orbits to report perturbations that were interpreted as an interaction between a dust torus created by Phobos and the solar wind [Dubinin, 1993; Yeroshenko, 2000] or by a putative Phobosian magnetosphere [Mordovskaya et al., 2001]."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "Phobosian",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6d6e3482-d61e-346f-96b1-19a7ad77d39e",
                                        "entry_id": "3b8c8c72-6f7c-30d4-8b94-de9fea79dbae",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Someone from Phobos."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e74f1a5d-8e26-4a77-8ca6-5a46950da180",
                                                "sense_id": "6d6e3482-d61e-346f-96b1-19a7ad77d39e",
                                                "text": "I was taking Valerie's kid to the Central Park Zoo when the Phobosians and the Deimosians started uprooting the city's power cables."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5ad5cc97-b4d5-455c-b88d-30c150fca1fe",
                                                "sense_id": "6d6e3482-d61e-346f-96b1-19a7ad77d39e",
                                                "text": "The Phobosians are encamped outside Grand Central Station, barely a block away."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ca420649-7f12-48ea-8016-1691b5b44ce3",
                                                "sense_id": "6d6e3482-d61e-346f-96b1-19a7ad77d39e",
                                                "text": "After four days of thorough medical examinations, physicians from each species concluded a high level of mutualism could exist between the Phobosians and the Interspecies Coalition species."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ed426960-3958-4fdd-8efb-8f25d5277e1d",
                                                "sense_id": "6d6e3482-d61e-346f-96b1-19a7ad77d39e",
                                                "text": "Meanwhile, the female Phobosian who had introduced herself as Jay Jay led the passengers down a long, narrow ramp that was just wide enough for two people to walk side by side."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "ce3b7102-c974-4d76-a8b9-68735e7cb031",
                        "source_entry_id": "d986d178-1150-33dc-9c42-33cc6408fa02",
                        "source_sense_id": "4530e61b-87d0-3ef3-a5d1-fa03a0235ba6",
                        "target_lang_word": "Phobian",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Phobian",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3f88508e-442a-3cbe-b770-26b6e39d39b6",
                                        "entry_id": "e8d3ad5d-250b-3171-a7f0-6319051bac80",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Pertaining to Phobos."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "36b28dd6-49fe-44e2-8665-ab25c05001bb",
                                                "sense_id": "3f88508e-442a-3cbe-b770-26b6e39d39b6",
                                                "text": "From the period of precession of the Phobian orbit the oblateness of Mars is computed to be about 1/192, which exceeds that of the Earth."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "06ede5ff-079e-4458-8680-4cbe014de36c",
                                                "sense_id": "3f88508e-442a-3cbe-b770-26b6e39d39b6",
                                                "text": "This produces the unusual (to Earthmen) situation that the Phobian \"month\" is shorter than the Martian \"day.\""
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dbec342b-f1ee-4ea1-80c3-588c40f3d05b",
                                                "sense_id": "3f88508e-442a-3cbe-b770-26b6e39d39b6",
                                                "text": "If his stature in earthly measurement be taken as five feet ten inches, he would tower into the Phobian sky to a height over one and one-tenth miles."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a4797e18-5b68-4bdd-8a09-7ffea6cd2f89",
                                                "sense_id": "3f88508e-442a-3cbe-b770-26b6e39d39b6",
                                                "text": "I understood (again from the brochures) that our little Phobian virus was extremely virulent."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "Phobian",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b2481582-5ea2-374c-87a9-727d702c8158",
                                        "entry_id": "de267922-10e0-3540-9e42-d10979afb376",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An inhabitant of Phobos."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fc4adc84-5a72-48c2-b2ce-d6e479595f98",
                                                "sense_id": "b2481582-5ea2-374c-87a9-727d702c8158",
                                                "text": "In walking he would raise the toes of his feet above the heads of the Phobians to a height of five hundred feet."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "16561d84-5ff0-4874-a204-f771b05d124f",
                                                "sense_id": "b2481582-5ea2-374c-87a9-727d702c8158",
                                                "text": "You know the answer already as to why the Phobians acquired the plague."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "836a4bf8-9f6f-4ef7-a576-8812eda8bf77",
                                                "sense_id": "b2481582-5ea2-374c-87a9-727d702c8158",
                                                "text": "After conferring amongst themselves, the majority of the representative suspected that the Phobians were about to announce plans for another annexation of some economically troubled world."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "Phobian",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "04ea652c-a88e-3cdf-b943-648a526bc045",
                                        "entry_id": "8a9c113a-0d37-360e-abc6-8e60962e7ab5",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A member of Accra Hearts of Oak S.C., Ghana's premier football club."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "772dbef8-a6bf-4393-ba6c-1d8f17a25c0d",
                                                "sense_id": "04ea652c-a88e-3cdf-b943-648a526bc045",
                                                "text": "To mark the end of Relations Week a fun run over 8 km was held at the Phobians Athletics Club."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ccbeb3c3-838a-4a9e-97fe-bee8292afbcb",
                                                "sense_id": "04ea652c-a88e-3cdf-b943-648a526bc045",
                                                "text": "The determination of the Porcupine Warriors to make amends is not far-fetched as they matched the Phobians squarely in two off-season matches."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8165705a-8b5a-427f-83c8-9ec3a5169552",
                                                "sense_id": "04ea652c-a88e-3cdf-b943-648a526bc045",
                                                "text": "The club's supporters (estimated to be in excess of 2 million) painted the whole of Ghana amber that night, their elation especially informed by the fact that apart from winning the first Champions League of the Millennium, the Phobians now stay firmly on the rail of bitter rivals Kotoko, who won the old-format Champions Cup twice and were losing finalists on five other occasions."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
